# What Expo uploads for a mobile build. This file REPLACES .gitignore for the build archive, so it
# has to name everything that must stay out.
#
# The repo is a monorepo, and the mobile app needs only itself and one shared package
# (packages/shared-types/src, imported by mobile/). Everything else (the server, the websites,
# docs, data dumps) is never sent to Expo.

# Start by leaving out every top-level entry...
/*
# ...then bring back only what the app needs.
!/mobile
!/packages
/packages/*
!/packages/shared-types
/packages/shared-types/*
!/packages/shared-types/src
!/packages/shared-types/package.json

# Never upload installed packages or local build output, wherever they are.
node_modules
.expo
dist
web-build
*.log

# Local secrets and machine settings.
.env
.env.*
*.jks
*.keystore
